{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>They are abundantly satisfied</b> — like ירביון." "<b>And the meaning of Your house</b> — they are those who seclude themselves to serve HaShem in their house, and the service nourishes the soul, and knowledge of HaShem satisfies them." "<b>And the meaning of נחל</b> — that it does not cease."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:47.436275827Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}